Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Service Not Starting
If RHVM services fail to start:

# Check service logs
sudo journalctl -u ovirt-engine -f

# Check for port conflicts
sudo ss -tlnp | grep -E "(443|80)"

# Restart services in order
sudo systemctl restart postgresql
sudo systemctl restart httpd
sudo systemctl restart ovirt-engine
Issue 2: Web Console Not Accessible
If you cannot access the web console:

# Check firewall status
sudo firewall-cmd --list-all

# Verify Apache configuration
sudo httpd -t

# Check SSL certificates
sudo openssl x509 -in /etc/pki/ovirt-engine/certs/apache.cer -text -noout
Issue 3: Environment Variables Not Persistent
If environment variables are not loading:

# Check bash profile
cat ~/.bashrc | grep rhvm

# Manually source the environment
source ~/rhvm-config/rhvm-env.sh

# Verify variables are set
env | grep RHVM
